Numinia Platform — multi-licensed monorepo
Copyright (c) 2026 Numen Games S.L.

This repository mixes licenses by directory, per Numinia canon C-005
(docs/legal-book.md, adopted in ADR-019). The authoritative per-file map is
REUSE.toml; full license texts live in LICENSES/.

Summary of the map:

  apps/*                       AGPL-3.0-only   (deployable apps that decide)
  packages/*                   MIT             (libraries, SDKs, types, tokens)
  docs/*, missions/, features/ CC-BY-4.0       (documentation, ADRs, specs)
  khepri/, fixtures, data      CC0-1.0         (design system, data snapshots)
  lore & brand                 All rights reserved (see REUSE.toml annotations)
  third-party (fonts, icons)   their own licenses (OFL-1.1, MIT)

Trademarks are governed by TRADEMARKS.md and are not licensed by any of the
above. The digital goods served by the platform live in their own repository
under their own CC0 terms.
